<main class="sayori-home">
    <section class="sayori-section pt-16 lg:pt-24">
        <div class="max-w-[1180px] mx-auto px-5">
            <p class="hero-eyebrow">CATEGORY</p>
            <h1 class="font-serif text-[clamp(3rem,8vw,5.5rem)] leading-[0.92] mt-4">
                Social
                <span class="text-[var(--sayori-lavender)]">
                    Deduction
                </span>
            </h1>

            <p class="hero-description mt-6 max-w-2xl">
                Hidden information.
                Careful discussion.
                Broken trust.
                Every decision changes the game.
            </p>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mt-12">

                <div class="game-stat bg-[var(--sayori-surface)]">
                    <span>Games</span>
                    <strong>3</strong>
                </div>

                <div class="game-stat bg-[var(--sayori-surface)]">
                    <span>Players</span>
                    <strong>4-25</strong>
                </div>

                <div class="game-stat bg-[var(--sayori-surface)]">
                    <span>Commands</span>
                    <strong>6+</strong>
                </div>

                <div class="game-stat bg-[var(--sayori-surface)]">
                    <span>Status</span>
                    <strong>Active</strong>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Sidebar -->
    <aside class="hidden lg:block">
        <div class="sticky top-8">
            <div class="sidebar-card bg-[var(--sayori-surface)]">
                <p class="section-kicker">Games</p>
                <nav class="mt-6 space-y-2">
                    <a href="#mafia" class="sidebar-link hover:bg-[var(--sayori-raised)] hover:color-[var(--sayori-lavender)]">
                        🌛 Mafia
                    </a>
                    <a href="#gta" class="sidebar-link hover:bg-[var(--sayori-raised)] hover:color-[var(--sayori-lavender)]">
                        🕵 Guess the Agent
                    </a>
                    <a href="#fn" class="sidebar-link hover:bg-[var(--sayori-raised)] hover:color-[var(--sayori-lavender)]">
                        🗡️ Final Night
                    </a>

                    <a href="#coming-soon" class="sidebar-link hover:bg-[var(--sayori-raised)] hover:color-[var(--sayori-lavender)]">
                        ＋ More Coming Soon
                    </a>
                </nav>
                <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-[var(--sayori-border)]">

                    <p class="text-sm text-[var(--sayori-muted)]">
                        Need a specific command?
                    </p>
                    <a href="?explore" class="sayori-btn mt-4">
                        📖 Gamebook
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </aside>
    <div class="hidden lg:block min-h-[8px]"></div>

    <!-- Only visible on mobile -->
    <div class="lg:hidden mb-10 max-w-[99vw]">
        <select
            class="w-[99vw] max-w-[99vw] bg-[var(--sayori-surface)] border border-[var(--sayori-border)] rounded-xl p-4 text-[var(--sayori-text)]"
            onchange="location.hash=this.value">
            <option value="">Browse Games</option>
            <option value="mafia"> Mafia </option>
            <option value="gta"> Guess the Agent </option>
            <option value="fn"> Final Night </option>
        </select>
    </div>
    <div>

        <section id="mafia"
            class="game-card rounded-3xl overflow-hidden bg-[var(--sayori-surface)] border border-[var(--sayori-border)]">
            <header class="card-header px-8 py-12">
                <div class="card-symbol">
                    <img src="/images/sayori/Sayori_mafia.png" alt="Mafia" class="card-symbol">
                </div>
                <h2 class="text-2xl text-[var(--sayori-lavender-bright)]">Mafia</h2>
                <p class="card-tagline">
                    The world sleeps.
                    The Mafia doesn't.
                </p>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-8">
                    <div class="game-chip">
                        👥 4–25
                    </div>
                    <div class="game-chip">
                        ⏱ 15–30 min
                    </div>
                    <div class="game-chip">
                        💬 Text + Voice
                    </div>
                    <div class="game-chip">
                        🎭 Hidden Roles
                    </div>

                </div>

            </header>

            <div class="px-8 pb-8 space-y-10">
                <section>
                    <h3 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xl font-semibold mb-4">🎮 How to Play</h3>
                    <p class="text-[var(--sayori-muted)] leading-8">
                        Every player is secretly assigned a role. Night time mafia kill someone, during the day players
                        discuss. The game continues until the civilians or mafia's are eliminated.
                    </p>
                </section>
                <section>

                    <h3 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xl font-semibold mb-4">🎭 Roles</h3>

                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
                        <span class="game-chip">Civilian</span>
                        <span class="game-chip">Mafia</span>
                        <span class="game-chip">Doctor</span>
                        <span class="game-chip">Detective</span>
                        <span class="game-chip">+ More</span>
                    </div>

                    <p class="text-[var(--sayori-muted)] mt-5 leading-8">
                        Every role has a unique objective. Some can inspect a users role, some can protect teammates,
                        while the Mafias work together to decieve the civilians.
                    </p>
                </section>
                <section>

                    <h3 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xl font-semibold mb-4">⌨ Commands</h3>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
                        <button class="copy-command p-2 rounded" data-command="/mafia">
                            /mafia
                        </button>
                        <button class="copy-command p-2 rounded" data-command="/mafia action: Skip">
                            /mafia action: Skip
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </section>
                <section>
                    <h3 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xl font-semibold"> Tips</h3>
                    <ul class="space-y-3 text-[var(--sayori-muted)]">
                        <li>- Pay attention to how players vote, not just what they say.</li>
                        <li>- Revealing your role too early can make you an easy target.</li>
                        <li>- Even silence can provide valuable information.</li>
                    </ul>
                </section>
            </div>
            <section class="rounded-2xl border border-[var(--sayori-border)] p-6 bg-[var(--sayori-raised)]">
                <p class="section-kicker">Want to become a better detective?</p>
                <h3 class="font-serif text-3xl mt-3">Explore the complete Mafia guide.</h3>
                <p class="text-[var(--sayori-muted)] mt-4 leading-8">
                    Learn every role, night order, victory condition, advanced settings,
                    hosting tips, and strategy in the dedicated guide.
                </p>
                <a href="/shadowveil-studioz/sayori/mafia" class="sayori-btn sayori-btn-primary mt-6">
                    Open Full Guide →
                </a>
            </section>
        </section>
        <div class="min-h-[3px]"></div>
        <section id="gta" class="game-card rounded-3xl overflow-hidden bg-[var(--sayori-surface)] border border-[var(--sayori-border)]">
            <header class="card-header px-8 py-12">
                <div class="card-symbol">
                    <img src="/images/sayori/detective.png" alt="gta" class="card-symbol">
                </div>
                <h2 class="text-2xl text-[var(--sayori-lavender-bright)]">Guess The Agent</h2>
                <p class="card-tagline">
                    Who is imposter, among us?
                </p>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-8">
                    <div class="game-chip">
                        👥 4–10
                    </div>
                    <div class="game-chip">
                        ⏱ 5-10 min
                    </div>
                    <div class="game-chip">
                        💬 Text
                    </div>
                    <div class="game-chip">
                        🎭 Hidden Roles
                    </div>

                </div>

            </header>

            <div class="px-8 pb-8 space-y-10">
                <section>
                    <h3 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xl font-semibold mb-4">🎮 How to Play</h3>
                    <p class="text-[var(--sayori-muted)] leading-8">
                        Every player is secretly given a word, while Agent white gets no word. Agent red are the
                        imposters and have different word.
                    </p>
                </section>
                <section>

                    <h3 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xl font-semibold mb-4">🎭 Roles</h3>

                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
                        <span class="game-chip">Agent Black</span>
                        <span class="game-chip">Agent Red</span>
                        <span class="game-chip">Agent White</span>
                    </div>

                    <p class="text-[var(--sayori-muted)] mt-5 leading-8">
                        Everyone describe their words, while trying to eliminate agent red and white.
                    </p>
                </section>
                <section>

                    <h3 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xl font-semibold mb-4">⌨ Commands</h3>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
                        <button class="copy-command p-2 rounded" data-command="/gta">
                            /gta
                        </button>
                        <button class="copy-command p-2 rounded" data-command="/gta action:Begin">
                            /gta action: Begin
                        </button>
                        <button class="copy-command p-2 rounded" data-command="/gta action:Skip">
                            /gta action: Skip
                        </button>
                        <button class="copy-command p-2 rounded" data-command="/gta action:Kick">
                            /gta action: Kick
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </section>
                <section>
                    <h3 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xl font-semibold"> Tips</h3>
                    <ul class="space-y-3 text-[var(--sayori-muted)]">
                        <li>- Do not make your word obvious.</li>
                        <li>- Do not type your word anywhere in chat.</li>
                    </ul>
                </section>
            </div>
            <section class="rounded-2xl border border-[var(--sayori-border)] p-6 bg-[var(--sayori-raised)]">
                <p class="section-kicker">Want to become a better Agent?</p>
                <h3 class="font-serif text-3xl mt-3">Explore the complete GTA guide.</h3>
                <p class="text-[var(--sayori-muted)] mt-4 leading-8">
                    Learn every role, victory condition, and strategy in the dedicated guide.
                </p>
                <a href="/shadowveil-studioz/sayori/gta" class="sayori-btn sayori-btn-primary mt-6">
                    Open Full Guide →
                </a>
            </section>
        </section>
        <div class="min-h-[3px]"></div>
        <section id="fn" class="game-card rounded-3xl overflow-hidden bg-[var(--sayori-surface)] border border-[var(--sayori-border)]">
            <header class="card-header px-8 py-12">
                <div class="card-symbol">
                    <img src="/images/sayori/sayori_phone.png" alt="sayori using phone" class="card-symbol">
                </div>
                <h2 class="text-2xl text-[var(--sayori-lavender-bright)]">Final Night</h2>
                <p class="card-tagline">
                    Kill! Kill! Kill!
                </p>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-8">
                    <div class="game-chip">
                        👥 4–10
                    </div>
                    <div class="game-chip">
                        ⏱ 7-10 min
                    </div>
                    <div class="game-chip">
                        💬 Text
                    </div>
                    <div class="game-chip">
                        🎭 Hidden Roles
                    </div>

                </div>

            </header>

            <div class="px-8 pb-8 space-y-10">
                <section>
                    <h3 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xl font-semibold mb-4">🎮 How to Play</h3>
                    <p class="text-[var(--sayori-muted)] leading-8">
                        Players in a locked abandoned house. Everyone share a room with someone else.
                    </p>
                </section>
                <section>

                    <h3 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xl font-semibold mb-4">🎭 Roles</h3>

                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
                        <span class="game-chip">Residents</span>
                        <span class="game-chip">Killer</span>
                    </div>

                    <p class="text-[var(--sayori-muted)] mt-5 leading-8">
                        This game is still in development. We need volunteers to test the features out.
                    </p>
                </section>
                <section>

                    <h3 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xl font-semibold mb-4">⌨ Commands</h3>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
                        <button class="copy-command p-2 rounded" data-command="/finalnight">
                            /finalnight
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </section>
                <section>
                    <h3 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xl font-semibold"> Tips</h3>
                    <ul class="space-y-3 text-[var(--sayori-muted)]">
                        <li>- Pay attention to who is sharing room with whom.</li>
                    </ul>
                </section>
            </div>
            <section class="rounded-2xl border border-[var(--sayori-border)] p-6 bg-[var(--sayori-raised)]">
                <p class="section-kicker">Want to know more?</p>
                <h3 class="font-serif text-3xl mt-3">We too!.</h3>
                <p class="text-[var(--sayori-muted)] mt-4 leading-8">
                    Join us in testing the game, and become the part of early development of <code>Finalnights</code>
                </p>
                <a href="https://discord.gg/bcCs3PE86q" class="sayori-btn sayori-btn-primary mt-6">
                    Join Server →
                </a>
            </section>
        </section>
    </div>
    <div class="min-h-[6px]"></div>

    <section id="coming-soon" class="mt-16 p-2">
        <p class="section-kicker">
            More Games
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl mt-3">
            Coming Soon
        </h2>
        <p class="hero-description mt-4 max-w-2xl">
            Sayori is constantly growing with new games, experiments, and community
            ideas. Here's a small preview of what may arrive in future updates.
        </p>
        <div class="grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3 mt-10">
            <article
                class="rounded-3xl p-6 bg-[var(--sayori-surface)] border border-dashed border-[var(--sayori-border)] transition duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[var(--sayori-lavender)]">
                <span
                    class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs tracking-widest uppercase bg-[rgba(185,163,230,.08)] text-[var(--sayori-orange)]">
                    🧠Concept </span>
                <h3 class="font-serif text-3xl mt-5">Alibi</h3>
                <p class="text-[var(--sayori-muted)] leading-8 mt-4">We are not yet able to reach the conclusion regarding the mechanism but you can join the discussion.</p>
            </article>

            <article
                class="rounded-3xl p-6 bg-[var(--sayori-surface)] border border-dashed border-[var(--sayori-border)] transition duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[var(--sayori-lavender)]">
                <span
                    class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs tracking-widest uppercase bg-[rgba(185,163,230,.08)] text-[var(--sayori-orange)]">🧪Experimental</span>
                <h3 class="font-serif text-3xl mt-5">GTA v2</h3>

                <p class="text-[var(--sayori-muted)] leading-8 mt-4">
                    A new mode... in the existing <code>Guess The Agent</code> game.</p>
            </article>
            <article
                class="rounded-3xl p-6 bg-[var(--sayori-surface)] border border-dashed border-[var(--sayori-border)] transition duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[var(--sayori-lavender)] cursor-pointer">
                <span
                    class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs tracking-widest uppercase bg-[rgba(185,163,230,.08)] text-[var(--sayori-orange)]">
                    Classified
                </span>
                <h3 class="font-serif text-3xl mt-5">
                    D###hn##e
                </h3>
                <p class="text-[var(--sayori-muted)] leading-8 mt-4">
                    Even Sayori refuses to reveal what's hidden here...
                </p>
            </article>
        </div>
    </section>

</main>